<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT CALIFORNIA WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT CALIFORNIA WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, California 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$450,000 Toshiba Classic women's tennis tournament on Monday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>8-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Sandrine Testud (France) beat Asa Carlsson (Sweden) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Helena Sukova (Czech Republic) beat Chanda Rubin (U.S.) 7-5</p>
<p>3-0 retired</p>
<p>Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) beat Kimberly Po (U.S.) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>2-6 6-1</p>
</text>
